{"name":"Grell","size":"large","type":"aberration","tag":"","alignment":"neutral evil","hitDice":"9","armorName":"none","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"10","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"22 (5d8)","speedDesc":"2m, fly 6m (hover)","strPoints":"15","dexPoints":"14","conPoints":"13","intPoints":"12","wisPoints":"11","chaPoints":"9","blindsight":"12","blind":true,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"3","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The [MON] makes two attacks: one with its tentacles and one with its beak."},{"name":"Tentacles","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack_: [STR] to hit, reach 2m, one creature. _Hit_: [STR 1D10] piercing damage, and the target must succeed on a DC 11 Constitution saving throw or be poisoned for 1 minute. The poisoned target is paralyzed, and it can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success. The target is also grappled (escape DC 15). If the target is Medium or smaller, it is also restrained until this grapple ends. While grappling the target, the grell has advantage on attack rolls against it and can't use this attack against other targets. When the [MON] moves, any Medium or smaller target it is grappling moves with it."},{"name":"Beak","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack_: [STR] to hit, reach 1m, one target. _Hit_: [STR 2D4] piercing damage."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[{"name":"perception","stat":"wis","note":" (ex)"},{"name":"stealth","stat":"dex","note":" (ex)"}],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[{"name":"lightning (x0)","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"}],"conditions":[{"name":"blinded"},{"name":"prone"}],"languages":[{"name":"Grell","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"grell","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":0,"damage":[]}